# Client

Read `wiki/client.md` and `wiki/conventions.md` before editing. This is Next 16 — see `client/AGENTS.md`.

- Pages stay thin; logic lives in `features/<domain>/`
- Export new public APIs from `features/*/index.ts`
- Browser API calls: relative `/api` + `credentials: "include"` via `shared/lib/api.ts`
- Do not add `middleware.ts`; auth gate is `proxy.ts`
- Await `params` (they are Promises)
- TanStack Query for server data; Zustand only for chat preferences
- shadcn Base UI: `render` + `nativeButton={false}`, not `asChild`
- Tailwind v4: `bg-linear-to-*`, not `bg-gradient-to-*`
- Reuse 3s polling hooks for PENDING/PROCESSING sources and artifacts
